#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:1
msgid "Debug"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:3
msgid ""
"Undici (and subsenquently `fetch` and `websocket`) exposes a debug "
"statement that can be enabled by setting `NODE_DEBUG` within the "
"environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:5
msgid "The flags available are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:7
msgid "`undici`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:9
msgid "This flag enables debug statements for the core undici library."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:27
msgid "`fetch`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:29
msgid "This flag enables debug statements for the `fetch` API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:31
msgid ""
"**Note**: statements are pretty similar to the ones in the `undici` flag,"
" but scoped to `fetch`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:49
msgid "`websocket`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:51
msgid "This flag enables debug statements for the `Websocket` API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Debug.md:53
msgid ""
"**Note**: statements can overlap with `UNDICI` ones if `undici` or "
"`fetch` flag has been enabled as well."
msgstr ""

